    schema:description "<h2><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Start your engineering career at Graphcore</span></strong><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></h2> <p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Graduate opportunities at Graphcore are available in four technical areas: Silicon, Hardware, Software, and AI and Machine Learning.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Across the two year programme, you’ll build your foundations, grow your confidence, and take greater ownership of real project work. You’ll be supported every step of the way by your manager, buddy, and experienced colleagues.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Interested in starting your engineering career at Graphcore? Complete the form below to register your interest in future graduate opportunities.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p> Find more English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow" ;
    schema:hiringOrganization kgjd:employer-graphcore-early-careers ;
