    schema:description "Role: Microsoft Solution Architect / Technical Lead - Contract role Consulting Seniority: Manager - Principal Day rate: Negotiable and outside IR35 Project duration: 3 months with likely extension Location: Hybrid in London Support a management consultancy delivering a large-scale technology transformation for a major construction company, helping shape and deliver solutions across a broad Microsoft estate. We’ve a preference for you to apply directly via the Project Blackbook website as the consultancy will eventually view your profile in our platform. If you are already in the community, feel free to quickly apply here or reach out to your Blackbook contact, but no need to re-apply directly. Tasks Define solution architecture across Microsoft platforms, infrastructure and applications Support migration, integration and modernisation across M365, data, hosting and identity Provide technical leadership across ITSM, networking and wider transformation workstreams Requirements An independent consultant Strong Solution Architect / Technical Lead experience across a broad Microsoft environment Experience spanning M365, application migration, data platforms, infrastructure and identity Comfortable leading architecture within complex, large-scale technology transformation programmes Find Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow" ;
