    schema:description "<p><strong>Mission Brief&nbsp;</strong></p> <p>We are looking for a Senior PLM Architect to shape the technical foundation of our PLM landscape. Partnering closely with business analysts, engineering teams, and IT, you will translate business requirements into scalable Teamcenter solutions and ensure a reliable, integrated platform that supports the entire product lifecycle.</p> <p>Your Role in Our Space Mission:&nbsp;</p> <ul> <li>Own the technical architecture of the Teamcenter landscape, ensuring a scalable, secure, and maintainable PLM platform that supports business objectives.</li> <li>Lead the design and implementation of Teamcenter solutions, including data models, workflows, integrations, and system configurations, while promoting the use of standard capabilities where appropriate.</li> <li>Define technical standards, development guidelines, and architectural best practices, and provide technical leadership to internal and external development teams.</li> <li>Collaborate closely with PLM Business Analysts, business stakeholders, and IT teams to translate functional requirements into robust technical solutions.</li> <li>Drive the integration of Teamcenter with enterprise systems such as ERP, MES, CAD, and other engineering applications to enable a seamless digital thread across the product lifecycle.</li> <li>Ensure platform reliability and long-term sustainability by overseeing system performance, release planning, upgrades, technical documentation, and continuous improvement initiatives.</li> <li>Provide expert technical support for complex PLM issues, act as the highest level of technical escalation, and guide root cause analysis to ensure platform stability and continuous improvement</li> </ul> <p><strong>Qualification Checklist&nbsp;</strong></p> <ul> <li>Bachelor's or Master's degree in Computer Science, Engineering, Information Technology, or a related field.</li> <li>Extensive experience designing and implementing Siemens Teamcenter solutions, with strong expertise in areas such as BMIDE, workflows, data modeling, security, integrations, and Active Workspace.</li> <li>Solid understanding of PLM concepts, including product structures (BOM), document management, engineering change management, revision and effectivity management, and product lifecycle processes.</li> <li>Proven experience designing integrations between Teamcenter and enterprise systems such as ERP, MES, CAD, and manufacturing applications using modern integration technologies and APIs.</li> <li>Demonstrated ability to lead technical solution design, mentor development teams, establish architectural standards, and review technical implementations to ensure quality and maintainability.</li> <li>Strong communication and collaboration skills, with the ability to work effectively across business and technical teams and explain complex technical concepts to diverse stakeholders.</li> <li>Proficiency in English is essential.</li> </ul> <p>Bonus Skills</p> <ul> <li>German language can be beneficial.</li> </ul> <p><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\">Benefits&nbsp;</span></strong></p> <ul> <li><span lang=\"EN-US\"><strong>Employee Participation Program:</strong> Share in our success through our virtual company share program</span></li> <li><span lang=\"EN-US\"><strong>30 days of vacation: </strong>Enjoy the days off to relax and recharge </span></li> <li><span lang=\"EN-US\"><strong>Company pension plan:</strong> Secure your future with our company pension plan, featuring a 20% employer contribution after the probation period</span></li> <li><span lang=\"EN-US\"><strong>Subsidised lunch:</strong> Stay energised with delicious, subsidised lunches every day</span></li> <li><span lang=\"EN-US\"><strong>Public transport ticket:</strong> Commute with ease using a fully financed Deutschlandticket</span></li> <li><span lang=\"EN-US\"><strong>Rental clothing with laundry service:</strong> Enjoy hassle-free workwear with our convenient rental clothing and laundry service &nbsp; </span></li> <li><span lang=\"EN-US\"><strong>Sport Clubs membership:</strong> Stay fit with our sponsored sports club memberships (EGYM Wellpass)</span></li> <li><span lang=\"EN-US\"><strong>Individual learning allowance:</strong> Grow your skills with an individual learning budget granted after the probation period</span></li> <li><span lang=\"EN-US\"><strong>Childcare allowance:</strong> Receive a childcare allowance for your non-school-age children</span></li> <li><span lang=\"EN-US\"><strong>And Much More!</strong> Discover additional perks and benefits when you join our team. &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<br></span></li> </ul> <p><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\">Who we are</span></strong></p> <p><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\"><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/jW2V5vsMb_k\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\"></iframe></span></strong></p> <p><span lang=\"EN-US\">We are Isar Aerospace and we are at the forefront of New Space building a modern space business to enable faster, better and cheaper access to space.</span></p> <p><span lang=\"EN-US\">Our mission is to help democratise space and use it for good in order to improve life on Earth now and for the future generations.</span></p> <p><span lang=\"EN-US\">We are a fast-growing company aiming to provide sustainable and environmentally friendly launch solutions for small and medium-sized satellites and constellations into Low Earth Orbit. The company is privately funded by world-leading technology investors with strong commitment and support and our team is made of driven and talented people with a real passion for space innovation.</span></p> <p><span lang=\"EN-US\">We're making rockets in a way that hasn't been done before disrupting a traditional industry. If you are up for the challenge, want to work on cutting-edge projects and be part of a team changing the world for better, come, join us and launch your career!</span></p> <p><span lang=\"EN-US\">Want to find out more about us?</span></p> <p><span lang=\"EN-US\">Visit </span><span lang=\"DE\"><a href=\"http://www.isaraerospace.com/\">www.isaraerospace.com</a></span></p> <p><strong>Data Protection<br></strong>We process your personal data for the purpose of managing the recruitment process and assessing your application. For detailed information on how your data is processed, including your rights, please refer to our <a href=\"https://isaraerospace.com/privacy-policy\">Privacy Policy</a>.</p> <p><strong><span lang=\"DE\">Disclaimer<br></span></strong><span lang=\"DE\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">Isar Aerospace SE is an equal-opportunity employer committed to fairness and inclusivity. We do not prioritize any specific religion, gender, nationality, or background. Due to security clearance requirements, affiliations with countries listed under § 13 para. 1 no. 17 SÜG may affect the application process. All qualified applicants are encouraged to apply.</span></span></p> Find Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow" ;
