    schema:description "With our brands Holzprofi24 and Leondo, we operate some of the leading e-commerce platforms for Home & Garden in Europe. We combine modern web technologies, data-driven online marketing, and high-performance logistics to provide our customers with an outstanding shopping experience. To further strengthen our tech setup, we are looking for a Software Developer (f/m/d) MS Dynamics 365 BC, who will actively shape our system landscape, drive integration and development processes, and build scalable, future-proof ERP solutions for our growing business. Further development and customization of Microsoft Dynamics 365 Business Central (version 21 and above) Implementation and maintenance of API and integrations Management and operation of Business Central server services SQL Server tuning, maintenance, backups, and performance monitoring Azure DevOps: deployment pipelines, repositories, work items Close collaboration with internal teams and external partners Solid experience in development with AL Strong knowledge of Visual Studio Code, Git, and Azure DevOps Expertise in integrating external systems via API Experience in administering Microsoft SQL Server Practical understanding of cloud services Passion for clean and sustainable codes and solutions Find more English Speaking Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow" ;
